
title: Liliana
---
<<declare $metLiliana = false>>
<<declare $spokeToLilianaAboutTower = false>>
<<if $metLiliana == false>>
    Liliana: Ahh! Who's there?!
    {$playerName}: Whoa! Sorry, I didn't mean to scare you.
    Liliana: Oh, thank goodness...
    Liliana: You're actually a person, aren't you?
    {$playerName}: Last time I checked.
    Liliana: Sorry! I wasn't expecting to find anyone else here.
    Liliana: I've been wandering around since I woke up, and everything feels strange.
    {$playerName}: You woke up here too?
    Liliana: Wait, you mean the same thing happened to you?
    {$playerName}: I don't remember much about how I got here.
    Liliana: That's a little worrying...
    Liliana: The last thing I remember was being near the tower.
    Liliana: There was this strange noise, almost like something breaking.
    Liliana: Then everything started shaking.
    Liliana: I remember a bright flash of light...
    Liliana: And then nothing.
    {$playerName}: So you woke up on this island?
    Liliana: Exactly!
    Liliana: I thought I was dreaming.
    Liliana: I mean, we're standing on an island floating in the sky!
    {$playerName}: Have you seen anyone else around here?
    Liliana: Actually, yes!
    Liliana: I've seen a few people wandering around.
    Liliana: Some seem just as confused as we are.
    Liliana: I haven't spoken to everyone.
    Liliana: However, I think we all ended up here after something happened at the tower.
    {$playerName}: That sounds like more than a coincidence.
    Liliana: I think so too.
    Liliana: Whatever happened there must have affected more than just us.
    <<set $metLiliana = true>>
    <<jump LilianaTowerInformation>>
<<else>>
    Liliana: Oh! {$playerName}, it's good to see you again.
    <<jump LilianaReturn>>
<<endif>>
===

title: LilianaTowerInformation
---
<<if $towerInvestigationStarted == true && $spokeToLilianaAboutTower == false>>
    <<set $spokeToLilianaAboutTower = true>>
    <<set $towerPeopleSpokenTo += 1>>
    //Liliana counts as one person interviewed.
<<endif>>
<<if $towerInvestigationStarted == true && $spokeToLilianaAboutTower == false>>
    <<set $spokeToLilianaAboutTower = true>>
    <<set $towerPeopleSpokenTo += 1>>
<<endif>>
<<jump LilianaGemQuest>>
===

title: LilianaGemQuest
---

<<if $gemQuestComplete == true>>
    Liliana: Thank you again for finding my gem.
    Liliana: I feel much better knowing it's safe.
<<elseif has_item("gem")>>
    Liliana: Wait a moment...
    Liliana: Is that the gem I've been looking for?!
    -> Give the Gem
        {$playerName}: You mean this?
        Liliana: Yes! That's exactly the one!
        Liliana: I can't believe you found it!
        <<start_quest QuestManager "find_gem">>
        <<remove_item GameManager "gem">>
        <<set $gemQuestComplete = true>>
        Liliana: Thank you so much, {$playerName}.
        Liliana: I was starting to think I'd lost it forever.
        Liliana: I want you to have something in return.
        Liliana: I found this some time ago.
        Liliana: Perhaps you'll find someone who would appreciate it.
        <<give_special_gift GameManager>>
        <<complete_quest QuestManager "find_gem">>
        {$playerName}: Thank you.
    -> Keep the Gem
        {$playerName}: I think I'll hold onto it for now.
        Liliana: Oh... I see.
        Liliana: Well, if you change your mind, please let me know.
        <<start_quest QuestManager "find_gem">>
<<else>>
    <<if $gemQuestComplete == false>>
        Liliana: Oh! Before you go, could I ask you something?
        {$playerName}: What is it?
        Liliana: When I woke up here, I realised something important was missing.
        Liliana: A gem I always kept with me.
        Liliana: It's quite precious to me, and I'm worried I lost it somewhere on the island.
        {$playerName}: What does it look like?
        Liliana: It's a strange-looking gem.
        Liliana: You should recognise it if you come across it.
        Liliana: Would you mind keeping an eye out for it?
        {$playerName}: Sure. If I find it, I'll bring it back.
        Liliana: Really? Thank you so much!
        <<start_quest QuestManager "find_gem">>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===

title: LilianaReturn
---
-> Ask about the tower
    {$playerName}: Can you remind me what you remember about the tower?
    Liliana: There was a strange noise, and everything started shaking.
    Liliana: Then a bright light appeared.
    Liliana: That's the last thing I remember before waking up here.
    <<jump LilianaTowerInformation>>
-> Ask about the missing gem
    <<jump LilianaGemQuest>>
-> Leave
    {$playerName}: I'll keep looking around.
    Liliana: Take care, {$playerName}.
===

